DESCRIPTION:Lee Syatt is the co-host of Joey Diaz' The Church of What's Hap
 pening Now podcast and has been heard on The Joe Rogan Experience\, Getting
  Doug with High\, Tin Foil Hat\, and SiriusXM. Lee has performed multiple t
 imes on Broadway and performs every night all over North America headlining
  and opening up for your favorite comedians like Joey Diaz\, Josh Wolf\, Je
 ssimae Peluso\, and Michael Ian Black to name a few. Lee was also selected 
 to perform in the prestigious Boston Comedy Festival in 2024 and performed 
 in the Moontower and New York Comedy Festivals in 2025. Lee's sense of humo
 r is very self deprecating and will delight comedy fans of all ages and bac
 kgrounds.\n\nManagement reserves the right to prevent customers from enteri
